THIRD-PARTY DATA

The licence above covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the
catalogue data, which is downloaded at build time from third parties and is
not redistributed here. Each source keeps its own terms:

  MovieLens (GroupLens Research)   https://grouplens.org/datasets/movielens/
    Research use; not redistributed. See the README shipped in the download.

  Free Music Archive metadata      https://github.com/mdeff/fma
    Track metadata under the terms stated by that project.

  Spotify song metadata            public dataset, per its publisher's terms

  Failte Ireland Open Data         https://failteireland.ie/
    Irish public sector open data.

  ThemeParks.wiki                  https://themeparks.wiki/
    Public API, per its published terms of use.

Titles, ratings, descriptions and locations belong to their respective owners.
They are used here for a non-commercial student project. Anyone reusing this
code is responsible for meeting each source's terms for their own use.

